       the exact host/table that failed, and state that access needs to be updated so
       Zach can talk to SpiderRock. Do not silently skip the check or infer fill quality
       from anything else.
    NOTE (2026-08-25): the digest now computes all of this in its FILL QUALITY section --
    per-fill fillPrice vs fillBid/fillAsk, the flag, and the loud access-failure warning.
